      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>武器（链枷），珍稀（需同调）</em> <br />这把灰色的链枷摸起来是冰冷的。使用这把魔法武器进行的攻击检定和伤害掷骰获得+1加值，并且对物件和建筑物造成双倍伤害。</p><p>此外，当你用此武器击中生物时，你可以迫使该生物进行 [[/save ability=con dc=15]]豁免检定。若豁免失败，则该生物中毒1分钟。中毒生物在每个回合开始时都会受到[[/damage 2d4 type=necrotic]]点暗蚀伤害。该生物可以在每个回合结束时重复豁免检定，成功后结束该效应对自身的效果。此项属性一经使用，直到下次黎明前不能再次使用。</p><p>This ash-gray flail is cold to the touch. You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon, and it deals double damage to objects and structures.</p><p>Additionally, when you hit a creature with this weapon, you can force the creature to make a [[/save ability=con dc=15]] saving throw. On a failed save, the creature has the poisoned condition for 1 minute. The poisoned creature takes [[/damage 2d4 type=necrotic]] damage at the start of each of its turns. The creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. Once this property is used in this way, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
